<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!--
  SYNTHETIC EXAMPLE. Every object, person, transaction, date and citation in
  this file is invented. It exists to exercise the LIDO adapter's mappings and
  the heuristic layer's rules; it describes no real object and asserts nothing
  about any real person or institution.

  It exercises, in order: the native eventType mappings (Purchase, Gift,
  Restitution); the generic "Change of legal title" carrier with the REAO
  state supplied through PROVENA_EXT; the five extension fields that have no
  native LIDO carrier; date precision derived from the granularity of
  earliestDate/latestDate, including a year expanded to 1 Jan - 31 Dec;
  precision that only PROVENA_EXT can express (circa, before); place built
  from a partOfPlace hierarchy; name variants through appellationValue
  @lido:pref; source citation through sourceDescriptiveNote; and an eventType
  the map deliberately leaves unmapped, which produces an ingest note rather
  than a guessed REAO state.
-->
